LC tank sustained by a saturating negative conductance
* Provenance: original parallel tank, cubic current gives a stable cycle.
* sansho-verify: pss-ng v(out)
Ltank out 0 1m
Ctank out 0 1u ic=0.5
Bactive out 0 I={0.004*(v(out)*v(out)-1)*v(out)}
.options reltol=1e-5
.pss 4k 2m ltank#branch 256 10 25 1e-5 uic
.end
